  Description: "COMPANION / UNCOMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nEach chest opened during
    the run adds 2% attack speed to this ally, up to 20%, applied when the next battle
    is prepared.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nRun / Enemy count: +10%\nRun / Score multiplier:
    +10%\nChampion / Maximum health: -1\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging three
    units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING REALM\nSeparated from
    a sibling at a crossing, they wear mismatched cloth recording the strangers who
    helped them continue. They seek their sibling without pretending every newer
    connection is temporary.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nEvery 4s in combat, attempt to
    heal the hero for 1.5 HP before healing modifiers. Healing restrictions apply.\r\n\nNamed
    talents count bodies and absorbed memories; their stated percentages are not
    multiplied by star level unless explicitly stated. Listed support modifiers scale
    separately at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: astral, shoe. Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment;
    two equal-species/equal-star bodies merge unless the talent forbids it."
